<description>&lt;p&gt;CAR forces have completed Rwanda special forces and basic special operations training and have neutralised 34 Boko Haram and ISWAP fighters in the Lake Chad area. The United Nations Security Council renewed the MINUSCA mandate to 2027, reduced the troop ceiling to 12,000 and plans a gradual drawdown of peacekeepers. Saudi support is backing a second year of a counter-terrorism programme for Sahel countries in Chad, while tensions are rising between Chad and Niger amid regional realignments. Two inmates were killed and 30 escaped during a prison break in Chad. The conflict produced 246 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE5EOVdDWDI4S3VnYmVXUDBCM21ORUdRNDE1TVMyV1k4QVdIQmR6MkhsYmJWMjBZaFpHMk12dFlQQUhZWkhhd0ZIQXFvX2RLbUZYMEpXWE5PWkk?oc=5&quot;&gt;AFP Fact Check&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOdHlLS2NNNGVkUGhTSVBxM3I2QzdOWGpuaVFOYzVTRXd5NWdrdXU2UDFKSDlVUFlETUFVODFwcG5oNUVLVFJxdUpZSWhXeFRPN3d0bWpOWEVMTXNsWjF5WEduLVVOdGM3Z3NObk1kMG4wbmZaSmZuRjItQW9ObTVSTWhXQVBHUTRaeWIycWlJUmZRdTVHdTB4OFZ1aEFIMGF0NVp3LW5JdGU5cE9tTFRiZENWQVFiaDRF?oc=5&quot;&gt;San Bernardino Sun&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi-?oc=5&quot;&gt;MMA Fighting&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxNWG9mSG4zem80bzlGUjRhbzVMNGFCdjdxdEUxNURPVmswZFRITS1BVXFDTGoteU1IWUlZUXU1VFY4Zl9wSXBzZFlrdTRDRWtjNUZzSkFkZnpaODI4TV9OZ2hxdl9ITXpxdldscVhpUzdxN3huQjBlWC1halRNalFuWWw5cXA1enFRLWs1djJGSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Africa Defense Forum&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxOR2E4Rl9obFB5ME9GbzhYbkdTRW5MY3VyMmJLRmdCVVRuNFN2czcyckpxd0FhbWdEeDZncmlidmlETXZmcDk2QkdIUVg3eWJTaGRHXzNMOHR6RUJwbXFybzZVRW9mX2tXbk1WWmhNZjZtVkVwSUhjY3Rrc0hHMjR